MINOR SPOILER AHEAD



I have not seen this tin the Wheaton spoiler, nor in this group, so here it
goes:

When you have been hallucinating, have you ever seen your pet attack a
monster and wondered which one of them is your pet, then either taken a risk
and accidentally killed your pet or just stood there afraid of attacking your
pet?


NOW BECOMES THE SPOILER:

Yes, you can still recognize your pet when you hallucinate. Just walk next to
a monster you suspect, and chat with him/her! Your pet still answers you the 
same way whether you hallucinate or not.

